\" style='border-bottom: 1.11111px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font: 400 15px / 25px quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; min-width: 100px; max-width: min(30vw, 320px); padding: 10px 0px 10px 16px;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵銅鑼灣站E出口或天后站A2出口步行</p></td></tr><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\"><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border-bottom: 1.11111px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font: 400 15px / 25px quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; min-width: 100px; max-width: min(30vw, 320px); padding: 10px 16px 10px 0px;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">添馬公園（金鐘）</p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border-bottom: 1.11111px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font: 400 15px / 25px quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; min-width: 100px; max-width: min(30vw, 320px); padding: 10px 16px;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">遼闊草坪、維港景觀、斜道及平坦路面</p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border-bottom: 1.11111px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font: 400 15px / 25px quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; min-width: 100px; max-width: min(30vw, 320px); padding: 10px 0px 10px 16px;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵金鐘站A出口步行約5分鐘</p></td></tr><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\"><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border-bottom: 1.11111px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font: 400 15px / 25px quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubun